### Root Cause (confirmed in source)

In `packages/core/src/agent/message-list/message-list.ts`, the `updateToolInvocation()` method (line 719-768) preserves `providerExecuted` and `providerMetadata` from the original tool-call. However, the conversion from stored `tool-invocation` parts to AI-SDK `ModelMessage` in the `toModelMessages` path **drops** `providerExecuted` and `providerMetadata`.

